    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 14:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nen ba, nino pa Rwot tye obebino, ma jami ma onoŋo giyako ki botwu gibipokogi woko i kinwu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.14.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.14.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 14:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Pien abicoko rok ducu kacel ka lweny i kom Jerucalem. Gibimayo gaŋ woko, gibiyako odi, gibimako mon gibuto kwedgi tektek, nucu jo ma i gaŋ gibiterogi woko i opii, ento jo mukene ma gudoŋ pe gibiryemogi woko ki i gaŋ, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.14.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.14.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 14:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lacenne Rwot bicito ka lweny i kom rok meno ducu, kit ma lwenyo i nino me lweny. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.14.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.14.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 14:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I nino meno tyene bicuŋ i wi got me Jeituni, ma tye i nyim Jerucalem tuŋ wokceŋ; got me Jeituni bibarre iye aryo, cakke ki tuŋ wokceŋ dok kwede tuŋ potoceŋ, kun weko luŋ malac twatwal. Nucu got tuŋ cel bidok tuŋ acam, ki nucune mukene-ni bidok tuŋ acuc. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.14.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.14.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 14:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Luŋ me godina bitorre woko, pien luŋ me godi biwok ki i ŋete. Wubirino macalo ceŋ wuriŋo oyeŋyeŋ i kare pa kabaka Ujia me Juda. Lacenne Rwot Lubaŋawu bibino kacel ki jo mere maleŋ ducu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.14.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.14.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 14:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.14.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.14.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 14:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I nino meno ŋico ki koyo bibedo pe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.14.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.14.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 14:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Piny bibedo dyeceŋ nakanaka, Rwot ŋeyo man, pe dyeceŋ kadi dyewor, pien i otyeno ceŋ biryeny.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.14.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.14.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
